mmary>Sup&eacute;rieur</summary><div class="theme-items"><button class="indicator-item" data-metric="illiteracyHigherAll">Analphab&eacute;tisme - Ensemble (%)</button><button class="indicator-item" data-metric="illiteracyHigherGirls">Analphab&eacute;tisme - Filles (%)</button><button class="indicator-item" data-metric="illiteracyHigherBoys">Analphab&eacute;tisme - Gar&ccedil;ons (%)</button></div></details></div></details>
